[[!comment format=mdwn
 username="joey"
 subject="""comment 4"""
 date="2026-10-27T14:33:54Z"
 content="""
The git-annex test suite got a test for this in 
[[!commit 7fe5823d1747f7c2c1315dcc358cc600b096d58e]] and indeed it fails on
windows. It also fails on linux with LANG=C.

I think that the haskell magic package (pre 2.0.0) is not applying the
filesystem encoding to the FilePath when passing it to the FFI, since
it uses `withCString`. (I have my doubts about version 2.0.0 of that
package, which has some very dodgy LLM generated code around filesystem
encodings. I have not tested it.)

git-annex has now switched to the haskell libmagic package. That fixes
the problem on linux with LANG=C. The problem still exists on windows
though. I think it needs fixing in libmagic probably.
"""]]
